  "scaleNote": "This is a 250 m Terra MODIS NDVI point sample at the mapped reference center of the Mount Hamiguitan Range Wildlife Sanctuary. NDVI describes vegetation greenness, not forest cover, habitat quality, biodiversity, or species abundance. The sanctuary spans steep elevation zones and this one pixel is not a protected-area-wide assessment. Only good- or marginal-reliability 16-day retrievals contribute to monthly means; months without accepted observations are omitted. Only interior gaps up to two months are interpolated in the chart and audio; longer gaps remain empty. UNESCO's species inventory and conservation status are independent ecological context, not outcomes measured by this satellite record.",
